      "link": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/technology/samsung-affiliates-commit-1-billion-to-kkr-backed-helix-digital-ai-buildout/articleshow/134564547.cms",
      "title": "Samsung, affiliates commit $1 billion to KKR-backed Helix Digital AI buildout",
      "summary": "Samsung Electronics, Samsung SDI 관련 기사다. 기사 제목은 'Samsung, affiliates commit $1 billion to KKR-backed Helix Digital AI buildout'이다. Samsung Electronics will invest $500 million, while Samsung C&T, Samsung SDS, Samsung SDI, Samsung Life Insurance, and Samsung Fire & Marine Insurance will provide the remaining $500 million. Listen to this article in summarized format Agencies KKR-backed US-based AI infrastructure company Helix Digital said on Tuesday that Samsung and its affiliates had committed a combined $1 billion to support the company's global AI infrastructure expansion Here are some details: Helix said the commitment builds on more than $10 billion of capital already committed to its strategy Helix said it expects to use Nvidia technology, Samsung's technology, and Samsung's energy storage capabilities to accelerate the development and delivery of AI infrastructure In a separate statement, Samsung said the investment would help accelerate the global rollout of AI data centers through Helix while creating opportunities for collaboration among participating Samsung affiliates Helix said its anchor investors include KKR, the Kuwait Investment Authority, Nvidia, and others. 이 기사는 해당 기업과 연결된 해외 보도를 바탕으로 정리했다.",
      "original_title": "Samsung, affiliates commit $1 billion to KKR-backed Helix Digital AI buildout",
      "original_summary": "Samsung Electronics will invest $500 million, while Samsung C&T, Samsung SDS, Samsung SDI, Samsung Life Insurance, and Samsung Fire & Marine Insurance will provide the remaining $500 million.",
      "company_summary": "Samsung Electronics, Samsung SDI 관련 기사다. 기사 제목은 'Samsung, affiliates commit $1 billion to KKR-backed Helix Digital AI buildout'이다. Samsung Electronics will invest $500 million, while Samsung C&T, Samsung SDS, Samsung SDI, Samsung Life Insurance, and Samsung Fire & Marine Insurance will provide the remaining $500 million. Listen to this article in summarized format Agencies KKR-backed US-based AI infrastructure company Helix Digital said on Tuesday that Samsung and its affiliates had committed a combined $1 billion to support the company's global AI infrastructure expansion Here are some details: Helix said the commitment builds on more than $10 billion of capital already committed to its strategy Helix said it expects to use Nvidia technology, Samsung's technology, and Samsung's energy storage capabilities to accelerate the development and delivery of AI infrastructure In a separate statement, Samsung said the investment would help accelerate the global rollout of AI data centers through Helix while creating opportunities for collaboration among participating Samsung affiliates Helix said its anchor investors include KKR, the Kuwait Investment Authority, Nvidia, and others. 이 기사는 해당 기업과 연결된 해외 보도를 바탕으로 정리했다.",
